WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:10.292
Dad moved his desk into the attic.

2
00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:13.448
He filled the bookcase with his books.

3
00:00:13.449 --> 00:00:20.303
When Dad wasn't looking, Vinnie and Mandy hid the photo album.

4
00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:25.126
They put it in a bag and stuffed it far under his desk.

5
00:00:25.127 --> 00:00:29.531
"Dad's feet will never reach it," said Mandy.

6
00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:34.302
"Hopefully he won't look under there," Vinnie added.

7
00:00:34.303 --> 00:00:38.221
But a week later something terrible happened.

8
00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:40.981
"The bag is gone!"

9
00:00:40.982 --> 00:00:45.146
Mandy exclaimed as they stood alone in the attic.

10
00:00:45.147 --> 00:00:51.530
The children looked everywhere, but the bag wasn't in the room.

11
00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:58.515
Suddenly Mandy heard a loud bang outside and looked out the window.

12
00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:02.223
"Look, Vinnie," cried Mandy.

13
00:01:02.224 --> 00:01:05.284
"Dad's putting out the trash."

14
00:01:05.285 --> 00:01:09.792
Dad had just put a big box of junk by the street.

15
00:01:09.793 --> 00:01:12.903
"So?" asked Vinnie.

16
00:01:12.904 --> 00:01:17.124
"Silly, I'll bet the album's in there!"

17
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:23.112
cried Mandy as they watched their father walk into the backyard.

18
00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:27.932
The children ran downstairs and outside to the trash.

19
00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:32.894
Vinnie dove into the box of junk and began to search.

20
00:01:32.895 --> 00:01:37.534
"Here it is!" he shouted, lifting the bag.

21
00:01:37.535 --> 00:01:43.527
The album was still inside, and they hugged and danced around.

22
00:01:43.528 --> 00:01:48.160
Vinnie and Mandy happily went back into the house.

23
00:01:48.161 --> 00:01:52.576
"That was really close," said Mandy.

24
00:01:52.577 --> 00:01:56.042
"We have to find a better hiding place."

25
00:01:56.043 --> 00:02:00.353
"Let's take it back upstairs," said Vinnie.

26
00:02:00.354 --> 00:02:03.774
Once in the attic, Vinnie asked,

27
00:02:03.775 --> 00:02:07.355
"Hey, do you want to . . . ?"

28
00:02:07.356 --> 00:02:11.978
And before Mandy could answer, he opened the album.

29
00:02:11.979 --> 00:02:16.450
"Now this is cool!" he exclaimed.

30
00:02:16.451 --> 00:02:20.177
The old man was standing on a dusty road.

31
00:02:20.178 --> 00:02:23.339
Two men were standing before him.

32
00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:26.626
One was much younger than the other.

33
00:02:26.627 --> 00:02:31.797
The older man wore a long coat and was firing two guns.

34
00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:37.176
In the air were five glowing objects.

35
00:02:37.177 --> 00:02:41.038
"Is he a cowboy?" asked Mandy.

36
00:02:41.039 --> 00:02:45.453
"We're about to find out," answered Vinnie.

37
00:02:45.454 --> 00:02:53.053
The children felt their eyes closing and fell down the long, dark tunnel.

38
00:02:53.054 --> 00:02:56.169
They landed on something soft.

39
00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:59.322
Vinnie opened his eyes.

40
00:02:59.323 --> 00:03:02.981
"Where are we?" he asked.

41
00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:09.532
They lay in a covered wagon among sacks of potatoes, beans, and dried meat.

42
00:03:09.533 --> 00:03:16.424
"This stuff looks like someone is going on a long camping trip," remarked Mandy.

43
00:03:16.425 --> 00:03:21.075
The children had landed on a pile of rolled up blankets.

44
00:03:21.076 --> 00:03:25.392
Mandy noticed some clothing in one corner too.

45
00:03:25.393 --> 00:03:31.365
The wagon was moving slowly, but the ride was bumpy.

46
00:03:31.366 --> 00:03:36.308
"I'm hungry," said Vinnie, opening a sack.

47
00:03:36.309 --> 00:03:39.525
Inside were strips of hard meat.

48
00:03:39.526 --> 00:03:41.611
He picked one up.

49
00:03:41.612 --> 00:03:46.085
"Vinnie! Don't eat that!" Mandy whispered.

50
00:03:46.086 --> 00:03:50.357
"It looks like beef jerky," Vinnie said.

51
00:03:50.358 --> 00:03:54.306
He smelled it.

52
00:03:54.307 --> 00:03:57.867
Suddenly the wagon stopped.

53
00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:02.990
Then, someone opened part of the heavy cloth covering the wagon.

54
00:04:02.991 --> 00:04:06.774
A man wearing a cowboy hat looked in.

55
00:04:06.775 --> 00:04:10.247
"Well, look what I found in my wagon, boys,"

56
00:04:10.248 --> 00:04:13.523
he called out, staring at the children.

57
00:04:13.524 --> 00:04:20.099
Vinnie dropped the jerky.
